  "notes": "Source mutation remains forbidden; recovery uses source reads plus scratch-only writes. Valid PowerShell fixtures now declare the explicit sha256-full-file authority, while a dedicated missing-algorithm regression proves legacy or ambiguous evidence fails closed to review without consuming retries. Invoke-RerunAutoDestinationChecks.ps1 had contained only NUL bytes in the tracked baseline and was restored to runnable test content earlier in this work. A verified orphaned disposable TEMP fixture from an earlier interrupted run was removed only after process, path, reparse-point, and external-reference checks. MP-CHANGE-2026-0712-020's four live-root validations remain invalid and are not reused here. Representative real-media and operator-controlled disconnect/reconnect validation were not run and remain required before claiming production media-policy or real-device recovery readiness.\nReconciled the complete directly attributable CSV rerun lifecycle, recovery, queue, Network, contract, WebView, documentation, and test surface.\nRecorded generated summary counterparts for packet-owned changed sources.\nExtracted shared read-only rerun lifecycle evidence and refreshed generated navigation after removing the queue-to-process dependency edge.\nClosed after extracting shared read-only rerun evidence into a neutral domain and rerunning the full 202-test lifecycle suite.\nRegenerated the feature map after the neutral rerun evidence module changed the indexed source count."
